{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014CMzcHUc7h6yUA3WHv4H8y","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2025 reviewer guidelines review form scoring rubric\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"2025 Reviewer Guidelines\",\"url\":\"https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2025/ReviewerGuidelines\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR 2025 Reviewer Guide\",\"url\":\"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2025/ReviewerGuide\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"Development and Validation of a Scoring Rubric for Editorial Evaluation of Peer-review Quality: A Pilot Study\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC11000557/\"},{\"title\":\"CommunityConnect 2025 Scoring Rubric for Abstracts 5 Excellent 4 Good 3 Fair 2\",\"url\":\"https://irp.cdn-website.com/9100a73e/files/uploaded/2025_Reviewer_Rating_Form_(Workshop_Rubric).pdf\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about CoRL 2024 reviewer guidelines, but the results did not return specific information about CoRL 2025 reviewer guidelines, review form, or scoring rubric. \n\nThe search did return:\n\nCoRL 2024 submissions were evaluated based on the significance and novelty of the results, either theoretical or empirical. Additionally, papers could be desk rejected for formatting issues, anonymity violations, or scope issues.\n\nHowever, I was unable to find detailed information about the specific CoRL 2025 reviewer guidelines, review form, or scoring rubric in these search results. To access the CoRL 2025 specific materials, you may want to:\n\n1. Check the official CoRL 2025 conference website directly\n2. Look for announcements or emails sent to registered reviewers\n3. Contact the CoRL 2025 program chairs or organizers\n\nIf you'd like me to search for more specific inform