{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NxdQtiEDEqyGhLDQLqHAM4","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2024 2025 OpenReview review form overall score scale \"strong accept\" \"accept\" \"reject\"\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2024\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2024%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2025\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"What Drives Paper Acceptance? A Process-Centric Analysis of Modern Peer Review\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2509.25701\"},{\"title\":\"Can Small and Reasoning Large Language Models Score Journal Articles for Research Quality and Do Averaging and Few-shot Help?\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.22389\"}]\n\nThe search results returned general OpenReview pages but didn't provide the specific review form details. Let me search more specifically for the CoRL review form and scoring scale information.\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines\",\"url\":\"https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2022/ReviewerGuidelines\"},{\"title\":\"2025 Reviewer Guidelines\",\"url\":\"https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2025/ReviewerGuidelines\"},{\"title\":\"2024 Reviewer Guidelines\",\"url\":\"https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2024/ReviewerGuidelines\"},{\"title\":\"Uncertainty in Artificial Intelligence\",\"url\":\"https://www.auai.org/uai2023/reviewing_instructions\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Instructions\",\"