{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011NZyAQzT1Z9MNJLoGyhDqu","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 occsafe_vla 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (32 个)\\n\\n- **ablation_random_occ_s2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **ablation_occ_detach_s2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **occ_s1_fresh**: DONE (success) — \\n- **occ_s1_fresh_eval_50000**: DONE (success) — \\n- **occ_s1_fresh_eval_47500**: DONE (success) — \\n- **ablation_random_occ_s1**: DONE (success) — \\n- **ablation_random_occ_s0**: DONE (success) — \\n- **ablation_occ_detach_s1**: DONE (success) — \\n- **ablation_occ_detach_s0**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_occ_s0**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_vanilla_s2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_vanilla_s1**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_vanilla_s0**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_occ_s2**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_occ_s1**: DONE (negative) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-23\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 服务器 | GPU | 预计完成 |\\n|--------|--------|-----|---------|\\n| vanilla_retrain_s0 | westd-34685 | cuda:0 | ~16:48 UTC |\\n| full_occ_retrain_s0 | westd-34685 | cuda:1 | ~16:48 UTC |\\n| cutoff_s2 | westd-10894 | cuda:0 | ~07:30 UTC |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- gradient_analysis: 部分完成（Detach s2 + Random OCC s2 已跑），等 retrain 完成后跑 Vanilla + Full OCC\\n- cka_analysis: 脚本已就绪，等 retrain 完成后跑完整跨条件 CKA 对比\\n\\n## 梯度分析结果（已完成部分）\\n\\n### westd-34685 (Full OCC + Depth)\\n- Action/OCC 梯度余弦: -0.013 ~ +0.018（正交）\\n- Depth 辅助梯度 10-20x > OCC，方向相同\\n- SigLIP 晚期层冲突率 50%→19%\\n- CKA: Full OCC vs Depth diagonal = 0.108\\n\\n### westd-10894 (Detach s2 + Random OCC s2)\\n- **OCC 梯度流将 action 梯度放大 8-69 倍**（vs Detach）\\n- Detach action_loss=0.434 vs Random OCC=0.236\\n- Action/OCC 余弦: -0.006 ~ +0.027（正交）\\n- 冲突率 42-57%（~随机 50%）\\n- artifact: gradient_analysis_results (art_20260523_70512d)\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **cutoff_s1_eval** (success): CAR=0.798, TSR=0.918\\n- **cutoff_s0_eval** (success): 50r SafeLIBERO eval\\n- **depth_s1_eval** (success): 50r SafeLIBERO eval\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 23 / 负向 3 / 失败 0 / 共 26\\n\\n## 下一步\\n1. retrain 完成 → 完整 4 条件梯度 + CKA → 论文 Figure/Table\\n2. cutoff_s2 完成 → eval → Cutoff 3-seed\\n3. checkpoint 备份\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-34685: cuda:0 vanilla_retrain, cuda:1 full_occ_retrain, cuda:2 空闲, cuda:3 空闲\\nwestd-10894: cuda:0 cutoff_s2, cuda:1 空闲\\n\\n## 告警\\n（无）\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BLa5NK7aRBL7Mn9B28a4cv","session_id":"d0b8a538-408e-485b-8d42-e69bd1c2f218","uuid":"416d0c9f-6061-4b45-bdd4-877ca4161865","timestamp":"2026-05-23T04:37:17.716Z"}
