{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TwtS7GJ1RtwcT91EbZQcTb","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/occsafe_vla/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 24\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 04:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 方案：vanilla OpenVLA-OFT vs OpenVLA-OFT+占据辅助 在 SafeLIBERO 上对比 CAR\\\\n  rationale: '核心假设是空间表征影响碰撞安全，MVP 需验证最基本的信号：占据辅助监督是否改变碰撞行为。选 OpenVLA-OFT 因为是 factorial\\\\n    study 的 base architecture，SafeLIBERO 因为是唯一带碰撞标注的 VLA benchmark。2 条件对比是验证交互存在的最小实验。Pass:\\\\n    CAR ≥5% 提升且 TSR ≤3% 下降。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 04:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: 根据 Reviewer 反馈完善 MVP 判定标准：≥3 seeds、paired t-test、灰色地带规则、Level I 优先\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 4 个 warning：(1) pass/fail 灰色地带未覆盖 → 新增有条件通过规则；(2) 未指定 seeds\\\\n    → 改为 ≥3 seeds + paired t-test p<0.05；(3) SafeLIBERO level 未指定 → Level I 为主；(4)\\\\n    占据 GT 可行性是关键路径 → 提升为 P0。同时记录 MVP 局限性：无法区分占据特有效应与任意 3D 监督效应。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 04:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 范围缩小：单 suite (spatial) + 50K steps，训练用原始 LIBERO 评估用 SafeLIBERO\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现两个问题：(1) GPU 预算低估 3-4x（150K steps × 6 runs = 288-432h），缩到\\\\n    50K steps 降至 120-170h；(2) 训练数据不应包含障碍物场景，否则测的是避障学习而非空间理解迁移。修正为：在原始 LIBERO-Spatial（无障碍物）上训练\\\\n    + 占据 GT，在 SafeLIBERO Level I（有障碍物）上评估。这是科学上更强的设计——若 pass 证明占据监督赋予了通用碰撞意识。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 05:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: CoRL 2026 不可行（Reviewer critical），建议用户确认 AAAI 2027 为主目标\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立评估确认：CoRL 2026 (May 29 deadline) 串行依赖最短路径 6-9 天仅够 MVP，不够投稿论文。完整研究需\\\\n    870-1470 GPU-hours + 多步串行依赖（代码→训练→评估→OCC-CBF 设计）。AAAI 2027 (Jul 28) 提供 10 周 runway，时间线环境搭建+MVP\\\\n    (1周) → factorial (2-3周) → OCC-CBF (2周) → 论文 (2周) → buffer (1-2周)，宽裕可行。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 13:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: Post-MVP 实验扩展计划：5 条件 minimum + 2 suite + 2 level，利用 occ_data_dummy 作为 random\\\\n    control\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 评估当前 2 条件严重不足 AAAI 标准（中位 baseline 数 8）。MVP 通过后立即扩展到 5 条件最小集：(1)\\\\n    Vanilla (已跑) (2) +Occ (准备中) (3) +Occ detach=True (ablation，证明梯度回传是关键) (4) +Depth\\\\n    auxiliary (对照其他 3D supervision) (5) +Random occ labels (用 occ_data_dummy 训练，排除\\\\\\\"任意\\\\n    auxiliary loss 都有效\\\\\\\")。Benchmark 扩展到 SafeLIBERO Level I+II + LIBERO-Spatial 原始 TSR。论文差异化定位：首个系统交叉\\\\n    3D 表征与安全机制的工作（11/11 同行论文只做其中之一）。预估 ~350 GPU-hours / 8 卡 ~5 天，10 周 runway 内极其宽裕。待\\\\n    MVP gate 通过后执行。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 18:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: 接受 vanilla_s2 从头重启，不排查恢复；正式 eval 分两批（今晚 s0/s1 + 明早 s2+occ）\\\\n  rationale: vanilla_s2 原训练在 step 25K 因磁盘满崩溃，resume 也失败（exitcode 1），step 25K checkpoint\\\\n    大概率损坏。从头重启 ETA ~05:40 May 21，与 occ 训练 ETA (~05:20) 几乎同步。vanilla s0/s1 今晚 ~22:30\\\\n    完成可先做正式 eval 拿到 2/3 seeds 早期信号，s2 明早补齐。不影响 MVP 判定时间线。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_vanilla_s2\\\\n    role: subject\\\\n    result: restarted from scratch, ETA ~05:40 May 21\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 23:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP gate 追加 hard-task-only CAR ≥10pp 辅助判据，应对 ceiling effect\\\\n  rationale: Vanilla 50K baseline CAR=77%，7/10 tasks CAR≥90%（ceiling effect）。Overall\\\\n    CAR 改善被 easy tasks 稀释，5pp overall 差异必须全部来自 3 个 hard tasks (T3/T5/T6)。追加 hard-task\\\\n    CAR ≥10pp 作为辅助判据，更敏感地检测 occ 在关键场景的效果。主判据不变（overall CAR ≥5pp + TSR ≤3% drop）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_vanilla_s0\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: TSR=91%, CAR=77.5%\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_vanilla_s1\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: TSR=93.5%, CAR=76.5%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 08:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: 2-seed 初步 MVP gate FAIL，进入诊断→方法改进流程而非直接宣布 MVP 失败\\\\n  rationale: 'OCC 两个 seed 一致显示 CAR 恶化（-2.2%），gate 数学上不可能通过。但这是第一种配置（weight=0.01, detach=false），硬约束\\\\n    #7 要求至少 2-3 种不同类型方法改进 + oracle 才能 pivot。当前 4 个 ablation 实验正在做组件级诊断（occ_detach\\\\n    测梯度干扰，random_occ 测信号价值），结果将直接决定改进方向。成本：ablation ~12h GPU 时间 + 方法改进 ~1-2 天，远低于\\\\n    AAAI DDL（10 周）的时间预算。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s0\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: CAR=73.0%, TSR=91.0% (47500_chkpt)\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: CAR=76.5%, TSR=91.5% (47500_chkpt)\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_occ_detach_s0\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_random_occ_s0\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 09:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP gate 调整：取消 hard-task CAR 硬判据（降为方向参考），正式 gate 只看 overall CAR + TSR；论文目标定为\\\\n    Tier 1（negative → diagnosis → fix）\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 统计分析：20 rollouts/task 下 per-task CAR SE≈11pp，hard-task CAR gate\\\\n    的 10pp 阈值在 z≈1.67 下不可靠判定。正式 MVP gate 改为 Gate 1 (overall CAR≥82%) + Gate 3 (TSR≥88.8%)。论文策略：纯\\\\n    negative 无法发 AAAI (Tier 3)，需 ablation 提供机制 insight + 至少一种有效改进配置 (Tier 1)。10 周时间允许\\\\n    2-3 轮改进迭代。后续 per-task 分析需增加到 50+ rollouts/task。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: CAR=73.0% (47500_chkpt)\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: CAR=76.5% (47500_chkpt)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 11:43 UTC\\\\n  summary: OCC s1 learning curve 揭示 CAR-TSR tradeoff；occ_loss_cutoff_step 确定为最高优先级方法改进方向\\\\n  rationale: Learning curve 数据显示 OCC CAR 在 40K 追平 vanilla（+0.5pp），但 TSR 持续落后 12pp。这不是方法失败而是\\\\n    representation tradeoff——OCC 推动 encoder 向空间感知偏移，改善避碰但牺牲操作精度。occ_loss_cutoff_step（前\\\\n    N 步用 OCC 然后关闭）可能同时保留 CAR 收益和 TSR 恢复，是最直接的 Tier 1 fix。代码已准备好（commit a696ba6, occ_loss_cutoff_step\\\\n    参数已实现）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s1\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'learning curve 30K-40K: CAR 65→73 (upward), TSR 80.5→78.5 (stagnant low)'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 12:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: 撤回 D010 的 tradeoff 叙事——Reviewer 证明 CAR-TSR tradeoff 是训练中间态非收敛性质；cutoff\\\\n    实验降级为\\\\\\\"值得尝试\\\\\\\"而非\\\\\\\"最高优先级\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: s0/s2 在 47500_chkpt 收敛数据显示 TSR=91.25%(≈vanilla 91.8%)，CAR=74.75%(<vanilla\\\\n    77.0%)。收敛时不存在 tradeoff。s1 learning curve 30K-40K 的低 TSR 是训练中间态（CAR 先于 TSR 收敛），非永久性质。论文\\\\n    framing 应回到 \\\\\\\"neutral/negative + mechanism diagnosis\\\\\\\" 而非 \\\\\\\"tradeoff discovery\\\\\\\"。cutoff\\\\n    实验仍然值得尝试但预期需调低。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: '47500_chkpt: TSR=91.0% CAR=73.0%'\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: '47500_chkpt: TSR=91.5% CAR=76.5%'\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s1\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: learning curve 30-40K shows TSR lag, not permanent tradeoff\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 13:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'OCC 3-seed 数据确认 MVP FAIL + 新发现: OCC 放大 seed 敏感性 (TSR 跨度 12.5pp vs vanilla\\\\n    1.2pp)，纳入论文分析方向'\\\\n  rationale: 's1 45K 结果 (TSR=79%, CAR=69%) 大幅低于 s0/s2。3-seed OCC avg TSR=85.2%, CAR=74.0%,\\\\n    两个 MVP gate 均 FAIL。但 seed 不稳定性本身是独立的 mechanism finding: OCC auxiliary loss 可能干扰优化\\\\n    landscape。Tier 1 路线 (negative → diagnosis → fix) 继续推进，等 ablation 诊断后决定方法改进方向。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s1\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 14:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: 排除 occ_s1 出 aggregate 分析（resume 永久损伤）；MVP gate 基于 2-seed 50K 数据正式 FAIL；T3\\\\n    CAR 跨 seed 极端方差 (0%-80%) 纳入论文发现\\\\n  rationale: 'occ_s1 从 17500 步 resume 后持续恶化（50K: TSR=76.5%, CAR=68.5%），40K→50K 期间\\\\n    TSR -4pp / CAR -4.5pp，退化加速而非平台期。vanilla_s2 也有 resume 但表现正常，说明是 OCC+resume 特异性问题。2-seed\\\\n    50K avg (s0+s2): TSR=88.25%, CAR=76.5%, Gate 1 FAIL (76.5%<82%), Gate 3 边缘 FAIL\\\\n    (88.25%<88.8%)。T3 CAR 发现：s0=80%, s1=5%, s2=0% → OCC 在 narrow-passage task 上创造极不稳定的安全表现。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s1\\\\n    role: excluded\\\\n    result: resume_damage\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n  - D011\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 14:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: westd-34685 4 GPU 分配：cuda:0 跑 occ_s1_fresh 从头训练（纯净 3-seed）；cuda:1/2 跑 occ_s0/s2\\\\n    50r eval（per-task 统计功效）；cuda:3 备用\\\\n  rationale: 4 GPU 空闲不可接受。occ_s1_fresh (~13h) 填满 ablation 等待期并产出纯净 3-seed 数据（n=2 论文统计力度弱）。occ_s0/s2\\\\n    50r eval (~90min) 提高 per-task 分析精度，特别是 T3 CAR 跨 seed 方差发现需要更高 rollout 验证。vanilla_s2\\\\n    50r 待确认 checkpoint 是否在 westd-34685。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s1\\\\n    role: replacement\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s0\\\\n    role: extended_eval\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s2\\\\n    role: extended_eval\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 02:48 UTC\\\\n  summary: Ablation 50r 诊断 Case D（混合）：Random>Vanilla>FullOCC>Detach。辅助梯度流=正则化器（+2.9pp），BEV空间信号=有害偏置。启动\\\\n    Depth 辅助监督 MVP 验证自我中心距离信号假说\\\\n  rationale: 50r 数据推翻 20r 初步诊断。Random OCC CAR=0.806 显著高于 Vanilla 0.777(+2.9pp)，证明辅助任务梯度流本身有正则化效应。Full\\\\n    OCC CAR=0.769 低于 Random，说明 BEV 空间信号抵消了正则化收益。Detach CAR=0.745 最差，确认梯度流必要性。机制：BEV\\\\n    occupancy 的 allocentric 空间表示与避障行为不对齐（\\\\\\\"物体在哪\\\\\\\"≠\\\\\\\"如何避开\\\\\\\"）。Depth 的 egocentric 距离信号与碰撞避免因果关系更直接（近=危险），预测\\\\n    Depth > Random > Vanilla。用户已批准启动 Depth MVP。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_occ_detach_s0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: CAR=0.746 50r, worst\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_occ_detach_s1\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: CAR=0.745 50r\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_random_occ_s0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: CAR=0.814 50r, best\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_random_occ_s1\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: CAR=0.798 50r\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 03:01 UTC\\\\n  summary: 修正 D015：同 checkpoint (50K) 下 FullOCC(0.801)≈Random(0.806)>Vanilla(0.780)>Detach(0.745)。BEV\\\\n    空间信号非有害但也无额外收益。Depth 实验继续（用户指令）\\\\n  rationale: D015 混用了 47500(FullOCC) vs 50000(ablation/vanilla) checkpoint，导致错误结论。50K\\\\n    统一比较下 FullOCC CAR=0.801 高于 Vanilla 0.780(+2.1pp)，与 Random 0.806 仅差 0.5pp（不可区分）。正确解读：(1)\\\\n    任何辅助任务+梯度流都有正则化效应(+2-3pp)；(2) BEV 空间标签 vs 随机标签无可检测差异→空间内容的特异性贡献存疑但非有害；(3) Detach\\\\n    确认梯度流必要性。Depth 实验不停——用户直接指令\\\\\\\"尝试一下抓紧MVP\\\\\\\"，且动机仍成立：BEV 空间内容未提供超越 random noise 的收益，自我中心\\\\n    depth 或许能。等 occ_s1_fresh 3-seed 50K 数据做最终确认。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_occ_detach_s0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 50K 50r CAR=0.746\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_random_occ_s0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 50K 50r CAR=0.814\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 50K 50r CAR=0.832\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 50K 50r CAR=0.770\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 04:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: 3-seed OCC@50K CAR=0.797 > Vanilla 0.780 (+1.7pp)，撤回 D015 \\\\\\\"BEV 有害\\\\\\\" 结论。OCC\\\\n    有正效应但不足以过 MVP gate (0.797<0.82)。排序：Random(0.806)>OCC(0.797)>Vanilla(0.780)>Detach(0.745)\\\\n  rationale: 'occ_s1_fresh 50r eval 完成，3-seed Full OCC 数据到齐。@50K: OCC CAR=0.797 高于\\\\n    Vanilla 0.780(+1.7pp)，@47500: OCC=Vanilla=0.780。D015/D016 中 \\\\\\\"BEV 空间信号有害\\\\\\\" 基于 2-seed@47500\\\\n    的错误判断。Per-task @50K: T5 +10pp, T6 +4pp, T3 ≈持平。OCC 确实改善了最难任务的碰撞避免。但 (1) MVP gate\\\\n    仍 FAIL (差 2.3pp)；(2) Random(0.806) 略高于 OCC(0.797)，差仅 0.9pp 不可区分，说明正则化效应占主导、BEV\\\\n    空间内容有边际正贡献但不大；(3) T3 seed 不稳定性仍严重（OCC range 0.78 vs vanilla 0.22）。Depth 继续（用户指令\\\\n    + 作为对照），但动机从 \\\\\\\"替代有害 BEV\\\\\\\" 调整为 \\\\\\\"egocentric 信号能否提供更大收益\\\\\\\"。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: occ_s1_fresh\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 50K 50r CAR=0.788, 47500 50r CAR=0.802\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 50K 50r CAR=0.832\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 50K 50r CAR=0.770\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 19:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: Table 1 统一用 all-50K checkpoint 数据，修正 OCC TSR=0.894±0.050, CAR=0.797±0.032；移除\\\\n    dagger 混合注释\\\\n  rationale: 发现 Table 1 OCC 行 TSR/CAR 来自不同 checkpoint 组合（TSR≈47500混合, CAR=50K），内部不一致。选\\\\n    all-50K 因为 Random/Detach 只有 50K eval 数据，跨条件一致性只能在 50K 实现。OCC s0@50K +8.2pp 跳升可疑但数据本身可用；OCC-Vanilla\\\\n    差异 1.7pp 在 1-seed std(0.032) 内，论文已定位为\\\\\\\"边际正贡献不显著\\\\\\\"，叙事不变。47500 apple-to-apple（OCC=Vanilla=0.780）作为\\\\n    robustness check 在文中提及。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 50K CAR=0.832 (s0 anomalous jump +8.2pp)\\\\n  - exp_id: occ_s1_fresh\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 50K CAR=0.788\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 50K CAR=0.770\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 21:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: Random OCC 3-seed CAR=0.789±0.031，与 Vanilla(0.780) 差距仅 0.9pp 不显著；梯度流正则化\\\\n    claim 从\\\\\\\"正向提升\\\\\\\"调整为\\\\\\\"防止辅助 head 损害\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: 2-seed 时 Random(0.806) vs Vanilla(0.780) 差 2.6pp 支持\\\\\\\"梯度流提供正则化收益\\\\\\\"。3rd seed\\\\n    (s2 CAR=0.754) 拉低均值到 0.789，差距缩至 0.9pp（远小于 std=0.031）。新排序：Random(0.789) ≈ OCC(0.797)\\\\n    ≈ Vanilla(0.780) >> Detach(0.745)。核心发现从\\\\\\\"梯度流提供正向正则化\\\\\\\"转变为\\\\\\\"梯度流是添加辅助 head 时防止损害的必要条件（Detach\\\\n    -3.5pp）\\\\\\\"——更 nuanced，但对分析论文依然有价值。需等 detach_s2 eval 确认 Detach 3-seed 排序后更新全文叙事。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_random_occ_s2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 50r TSR=0.848 CAR=0.754\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_random_occ_s0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 50r CAR=0.814\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_random_occ_s1\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 50r CAR=0.798\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 22:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Detach 3-seed: CAR=0.746±0.002 极稳定（vs Vanilla 0.780, -3.4pp），TSR=0.812±0.163\\\\n    (s2 崩溃)。CAR 维度梯度流 claim 实际更强'\\\\n  rationale: Detach s2 TSR=0.624 (s0=0.914, s1=0.898) 崩溃，但 CAR=0.748 与 s0/s1 完全一致\\\\n    (std=0.002)。论文核心指标是 CAR（安全），不是 TSR（任务成功率）。Detach CAR 稳定低于 Vanilla 3.4pp，这是全条件最一致的效应。TSR\\\\n    崩溃是 Detach 有害的额外证据（不仅损害安全还破坏任务执行稳定性）。梯度流 claim 从\\\\\\\"正则化收益\\\\\\\"调整为\\\\\\\"防止辅助 head 损害的必要条件\\\\\\\"，CAR\\\\n    维度证据比 2-seed 时更强。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_occ_detach_s2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 50r TSR=0.624 CAR=0.748\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_occ_detach_s0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 50r CAR=0.746\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_occ_detach_s1\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 50r CAR=0.744\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 22:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: Detach s2 纳入 3-seed 统计（Option A），不排除。CAR 正常(0.748)，TSR 崩溃(0.624)作为 Detach\\\\n    有害的额外证据披露\\\\n  rationale: CAR=0.748 与 s0(0.746)/s1(0.744) 完全一致(std=0.002)，核心安全指标无异常。训练日志无 NaN/OOM/错误，checkpoint\\\\n    完整。排除 s2 无科学依据，且之前保留了 OCC s2（也有异常），一致性要求保留。TSR 崩溃(0.624 vs s0=0.914/s1=0.898)是全\\\\n    task 退化，本身作为 Detach 放大 seed 不稳定性的证据。T3 CAR 跨 3 seed 均极低(0.20/0.14/0.00)是 Detach\\\\n    系统性弱点，可用于 per-task 分析。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_occ_detach_s2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: TSR=0.624 CAR=0.748, TSR collapse but CAR normal\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_occ_detach_s0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: TSR=0.914 CAR=0.746\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_occ_detach_s1\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: TSR=0.898 CAR=0.744\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-23 01:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: Depth MVP Gate FAIL → Path B 确认：空间内容不重要，梯度流是唯一机制\\\\n  rationale: 'Depth 4-seed CAR=0.780±0.037，与 Vanilla(0.780±0.012) 完全一致。TSR=0.889 虽过阈值(≥0.870)，但\\\\n    CAR bootstrap 95% CI 下界(~0.721) 远低于 0.780 阈值，Gate FAIL。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    全条件排序确认：OCC(0.797) ≈ Random(0.789) ≈ Cutoff(0.783) ≈ Depth(0.780) ≈ Vanilla(0.780)\\\\n    >> Detach(0.746)。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    所有梯度流条件与 Vanilla 差距 0-1.7pp（σ≈0.03 内），统计不显著。唯一显著差异是 Detach(-3.4pp, σ=0.002 极稳定)。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    结论：辅助任务的空间内容类型（BEV/depth/random）不重要，梯度流的存在/缺失是唯一有效因素。论文定位为机制分析论文（Option B）。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: depth_s0\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: CAR=0.736, TSR=0.940\\\\n  - exp_id: depth_s1\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: CAR=0.818, TSR=0.906\\\\n  - exp_id: depth_s2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: CAR=0.758, TSR=0.860\\\\n  - exp_id: depth_s3\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: CAR=0.806, TSR=0.848\\\\n  - exp_id: cutoff_s0\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: CAR=0.768, TSR=0.912\\\\n  - exp_id: cutoff_s1\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: CAR=0.798, TSR=0.918\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-23 02:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: Reviewer 深度评估后调整优先级：梯度范数/CKA 分析升为 P0（必做），BatchNorm artifact 检验为 P1\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 评估 AAAI 接收率 ~25-30%，最大弱点是 R3（\\\\\\\"mechanism analysis\\\\\\\"无 gradient-level\\\\n    证据）和 R1（single VLA+benchmark）。梯度范数/CKA 分析 cost 极低（~3 GPU-hours）但直接回应 R3，ROI 最高。BatchNorm\\\\n    artifact 假说（Detach 损害可能来自 BN 运行统计而非梯度流缺失）是 Reviewer 发现的新风险，需要 Detach+LayerNorm\\\\n    实验验证。experiment_plan.yaml 已更新：plan_023/024 升 P0，plan_027 (Detach+LN) 为 P1。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation_occ_detach_s0\\\\n    role: analysis_target\\\\n    result: CAR=0.744, existing checkpoint for gradient analysis\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_occ_s0\\\\n    role: analysis_target\\\\n    result: CAR=0.832, existing checkpoint for gradient analysis\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D022\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 15918, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BLa5NK7aRBL7Mn9B28a4cv","session_id":"d0b8a538-408e-485b-8d42-e69bd1c2f218","uuid":"c0832029-dc7c-425d-b1e5-d32f46bc53b0","timestamp":"2026-05-23T04:37:22.574Z"}
