{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T8oAPUdFDnPC2HMoDn6eXy","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/occsafe_vla/literature_map.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Literature Map for OccSafe-VLA (AAAI 2027)\\\\n# Generated: 2026-05-20\\\\n# Paper: OccSafe-VLA: Occupancy-Conditioned Safety for VLA via Systematic Spatial-Safety Interaction Analysis\\\\n#\\\\n# Core gap: No work studies the interaction between spatial representations and safety\\\\n# mechanisms in VLAs. 15+ spatial-VLA papers never evaluate collision metrics;\\\\n# all safety-VLA methods ignore spatial representation advances.\\\\n\\\\npapers:\\\\n\\\\n  # ============================================================\\\\n  # CATEGORY: direct-competitor (spatial-safety intersection)\\\\n  # ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"liu2025occvla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"OccVLA: Vision-Language-Action Model with Implicit 3D Occupancy Supervision\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Liu et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2509.05578\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"direct-competitor\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"最近概念：occupancy + VLA，但面向自动驾驶\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"将 3D 占据预测作为 VLA 辅助任务，学习空间结构，推理时可跳过（零开销）。在 nuScenes 轨迹规划上达到 SOTA\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"OccVLA 仅验证自动驾驶；我们将占据辅助迁移到 manipulation，需解决精度尺度（厘米级 vs 米级）和动作空间差异\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"hu2025aegis\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"VLSA: Vision-Language-Action Models with Plug-and-Play Safety Constraint Layer\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Hu et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2512.11891\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"direct-competitor\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"唯一发表的 manipulation safety-VLA，plug-in CBF 方案\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"AEGIS plug-in 安全约束层用 CBF + 开放集检测 + 深度图，SafeLIBERO 上 CAR 提升 59.16%\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"AEGIS 是 plug-in 后处理，不影响 VLA 内部空间理解；我们将占据感知内化到 VLA 架构，实现预见性避障而非事后修正\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"zhan2025safevla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"SafeVLA: Towards Safety Alignment of Vision-Language-Action Model via Constrained Learning\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Zhan et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"NeurIPS 2025 Spotlight\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2503.03480\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"direct-competitor\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"RL-based VLA 安全对齐，NeurIPS 2025 Spotlight\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"用约束马尔可夫决策过程进行 VLA 安全对齐\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"SafeVLA 用 RL 方法，不涉及几何/占据表征；我们是几何驱动的空间-安全交互方案\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"chen2026cofreevla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"CoFreeVLA: Collision-Free Dual-Arm Manipulation via VLA Model and Risk Estimation\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Chen et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2026\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2601.21712\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"direct-competitor\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"半内化风险估计器 + collision labels\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"半内化风险估计器结合模型生成的碰撞标签实现无碰撞双臂操作\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"CoFreeVLA 不使用占据表征，风险估计不利用空间结构；我们的 OCC-CBF 基于占据特征做语义碰撞推理\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  # ============================================================\\\\n  # CATEGORY: spatial-vla (3D representation for VLA, no safety eval)\\\\n  # ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"li2025spatialforcing\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Spatial Forcing: Implicit Spatial Representation Alignment for Vision-language-action Model\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Li et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2026\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2510.12276\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"spatial-vla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"隐式 3D 对齐 SOTA，factorial study 的 general-purpose 3D 条件参考\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"将 VLA 中间层视觉嵌入与冻结 3D 基础模型对齐，超越所有 2D/3D VLA 基线，训练加速 3.8x\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"Spatial Forcing 不产生显式占据场，未评估碰撞安全；我们的 factorial study 将其作为 general-purpose 3D 条件之一\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"an2025depthvla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"DepthVLA: Enhancing Vision-Language-Action Models with Depth-Aware Spatial Reasoning\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"An et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2510.13375\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"spatial-vla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"深度辅助监督，factorial study 的 general-purpose 3D 条件参考\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"通过 mixture-of-transformers 添加深度 transformer，真实世界 78.5% 成功率\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"DepthVLA 未评估碰撞指标；我们将其与 Spatial Forcing 合并为 factorial 中的 general-purpose 3D 条件\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"chen2026gstvla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"GST-VLA: Structured Gaussian Spatial Tokens for 3D Depth-Aware VLA Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Chen et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2026\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2603.09079\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"spatial-vla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"最精致的结构化空间表征，LIBERO 96.4%，无安全评估\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"128 个各向异性 3D 高斯原语 + DA-CoT 推理，LIBERO 96.4%\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"GST-VLA 是 ICRA 2027 扩展版的候选条件（Gaussian 空间表征 vs 体素占据）；AAAI 版暂不含\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  # ============================================================\\\\n  # CATEGORY: safety-mechanism (barrier functions / occupancy-based safety)\\\\n  # ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"ji2024ogmcbf\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"OGM-CBF: Safe Robot Control using Occupancy Grid Map-based Control Barrier Function\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Ji et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2024\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2405.10703\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"safety-mechanism\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"OCC-CBF 的古典机器人学前身：离散占据网格 + SDF → CBF\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"从占据网格图构建 CBF，比原始距离更有效地处理任意障碍物形状\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"OGM-CBF 用离散网格 + SDF；我们的 OCC-CBF 在 VLA 连续学习特征空间操作，支持语义碰撞推理\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"kwon2026learningnudge\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Learning to Nudge: A Scalable Barrier Function Framework for Safe Robot Interaction in Dense Clutter\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Kwon et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2026\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2601.02686\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"safety-mechanism\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"学习型可组合 barrier function，manipulation 密集场景\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"Dense Contact Barrier Functions (DCBF) — 学习型、可组合、以物体为中心的 barrier function，线性扩展到任意物体集\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"DCBF 以物体为中心需显式物体分解；OCC-CBF 基于体积占据特征，推理连续空间结构含遮挡区域\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  # ============================================================\\\\n  # CATEGORY: infrastructure (base architecture / benchmarks / recipes)\\\\n  # ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"kim2025openvlaoft\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"OpenVLA-OFT: Fine-Tuning Vision-Language-Action Models: Optimizing Speed and Success\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Kim et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2502.19645\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"infrastructure\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"MVP 和 factorial study 的 base architecture\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"优化微调配方，LIBERO 97.1%，26x 加速\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"OpenVLA-OFT 是我们的受控基准架构，不是对比对象\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"ma2026vlanext\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"VLANeXt: Recipes for Building Strong VLA Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Ma et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2026\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2602.18532\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"infrastructure\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"系统性 VLA 设计空间探索，我们工作的正交互补\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"12 个关键发现覆盖基础/感知/动作维度，但不研究 3D 空间表征和安全机制\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"VLANeXt 给出任务性能配方；我们给出安全 VLA 设计配方。正交维度\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  # ============================================================\\\\n  # CATEGORY: spatial-vla (additional — 3D/depth/occupancy for VLA)\\\\n  # ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"wu2025spatialvla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"SpatialVLA: Exploring Spatial Representations for Visual-Language-Action Model\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Wu et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"RSS 2026\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2501.15830\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"spatial-vla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"大规模空间 VLA 预训练代表作，Ego3D Position Encoding\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"Ego3D Position Encoding + Adaptive Action Grids，1.1M episodes 预训练，零样本跨机器人泛化\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"SpatialVLA 无任何安全评估；我们首次研究空间表征与碰撞安全的交互\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"qdepthvla2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"QDepth-VLA: Quantized Depth Prediction as Auxiliary Supervision for Vision-Language-Action Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Li et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2510.14836\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"spatial-vla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"VQ-VAE 量化深度辅助监督方案，factorial study 参考\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"深度专家预测 VQ-VAE 量化深度 token，学习深度感知表征提升精细操作\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"QDepth-VLA 不产生占据场，未评估碰撞安全；我们将占据辅助与安全机制联合优化\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"geoaware2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"GeoAware-VLA: Implicit Geometry Aware Vision-Language-Action Model\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Abouzeid et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2509.14117\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"spatial-vla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"冻结几何视觉模型注入 3D 先验，视角泛化 +35pp\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"冻结预训练几何模型作为特征提取器，LIBERO 未见视角成功率提升 35 个百分点\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"GeoAware-VLA 关注视角鲁棒性而非安全；我们关注空间表征如何改善碰撞避免\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"augvla3d2026\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"AugVLA-3D: Depth-Driven Feature Augmentation for Vision-Language-Action Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Rao et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2026\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2602.10698\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"spatial-vla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"VGGT 驱动的 3D 特征增强，action assistant 约束\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"VGGT 提取几何感知 3D 线索 + action assistant 模块约束深度特征与动作一致性\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"AugVLA-3D 用 VGGT 增强任务性能；我们研究 VGGT 类 3D 特征能否同时改善安全指标\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"evo02025\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Evo-0: Vision-Language-Action Model with Implicit Spatial Understanding\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Lin et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2507.00416\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"spatial-vla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"VGGT 即插即用隐式 3D 模块，无额外传感器\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"即插即用模块利用视觉几何基础模型隐式注入 3D 几何特征，无需深度传感器\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"Evo-0 不评估安全；我们首次系统研究此类隐式 3D 特征对碰撞安全的影响\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"sgvla2026\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"SG-VLA: Learning Spatially-Grounded Vision-Language-Action Models for Mobile Manipulation\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Tu et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2026\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2603.22760\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"spatial-vla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"深度线索 + 辅助解码器用于移动操作 13 维动作空间\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"多视角 RGB+深度+时间历史，辅助解码器重建全局位置/关节/抓取可供性/分割掩码\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"SG-VLA 面向移动操作泛化；我们聚焦空间表征对固定基座 manipulation 碰撞安全的影响\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"stemvla2026\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"StemVLA: An Open-Source VLA with Future 3D Spatial Geometry Knowledge and 4D Historical Representation\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Xiao et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2026\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2602.23721\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"spatial-vla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"未来 3D 几何预测 + VideoFormer 4D 时空表征\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"预测未来 3D 空间几何 + 时序注意力聚合历史 4D 时空表征，增强长时决策\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"StemVLA 无碰撞评估；我们研究此类时空表征是否为安全 VLA 提供可利用的空间信号\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"3dcavla2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"3D-CAVLA: Leveraging Depth and 3D Context to Generalize VLA for Unseen Tasks\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Bhat et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2505.05800\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"spatial-vla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"深度+3D 上下文+CoT 推理，LIBERO 98.1%\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"链式推理+深度感知+任务目标 ROI 检测，LIBERO 98.1%，未见任务 +8.8%\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"3D-CAVLA 无碰撞评估；我们首次将类似 3D 上下文与安全机制结合\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"stvla2026\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"ST-VLA: Enabling 4D-Aware Spatiotemporal Understanding for General Robot Manipulation\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Wu et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2026\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2603.13788\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"spatial-vla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"4D 时空 VLA，2D 引导转 3D 轨迹，零样本 +44.6%\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"统一 3D-4D 表征，2D 引导转 3D 轨迹 + 时空掩码，RLBench 零样本 +44.6%\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"ST-VLA 关注任务泛化；我们关注 4D 时空表征能否被安全机制利用来预见碰撞\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"corridorvla2026\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"CorridorVLA: Explicit Spatial Constraints for Generative Action Heads via Sparse Anchors\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Li et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2026\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2604.21241\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"spatial-vla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"空间锚点定义 action corridors，模糊空间-安全边界但未评估碰撞\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"稀疏空间锚点定义容差走廊约束 flow-matching action head，LIBERO-Plus +3.4-12.4%\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"CorridorVLA 的空间约束面向轨迹质量而非碰撞避免；我们的占据 CBF 显式优化安全\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"geovla2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"GeoVLA: Empowering 3D Representations in Vision-Language-Action Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Sun et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2508.09071\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"spatial-vla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"点云编码器 + 3D 增强动作专家\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"深度转点云 + Point Embedding Network + 3D-enhanced Action Expert，LIBERO/ManiSkill2 SOTA\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"GeoVLA 无碰撞评估；我们研究点云表征能否被占据 CBF 利用来改善安全\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"pointvla2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"PointVLA: Injecting the 3D World into Vision-Language-Action Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Li et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2503.07511\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"spatial-vla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"轻量级 3D 点云特征注入，skip-block 分析定位注入层\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"冻结原始动作专家，通过 skip-block 分析选择性注入 3D 特征，少样本多任务泛化\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"PointVLA 关注数据效率和视角鲁棒性；我们研究 3D 注入是否同时改善碰撞安全\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"savla2026\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"SA-VLA: Spatially-Aware Flow-Matching for Vision-Language-Action Reinforcement Learning\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Pan et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2026\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2602.00743\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"spatial-vla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"空间表征+空间奖励+空间探索，最接近空间-安全连接\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"隐式空间表征融合+几何进度密集奖励+空间条件退火探索，解决 RL 微调空间偏移\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"SA-VLA 关注 RL 微调分布偏移鲁棒性而非碰撞安全；我们直接优化碰撞避免指标\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  # ============================================================\\\\n  # CATEGORY: direct-competitor (additional — safety-VLA methods)\\\\n  # ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"safenightvla2026\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Safe-Night VLA: Seeing the Unseen via Thermal-Perceptive Vision-Language-Action Models for Safety-Critical Manipulation\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Yu et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2026\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2603.05754\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"direct-competitor\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"热成像+CBF 安全约束，不同感知模态的安全 VLA\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"长波红外热成像融合语义推理 + CBF 安全滤波器，温度条件操作/遮挡目标定位\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"Safe-Night VLA 依赖热成像特殊模态；我们利用 RGB 空间表征进步实现安全，无需额外传感器\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"vlasafetysurvey2026\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Vision-Language-Action Safety: Threats, Challenges, Evaluations, and Mechanisms\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Li et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2026\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2604.23775\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"direct-competitor\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"VLA 安全综述，按攻击/防御时间线分类，不研究空间表征维度\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"沿攻击时间轴和防御时间轴组织 VLA 安全文献，覆盖数据投毒/对抗补丁/语义越狱等\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"该综述确认空间表征-安全交互维度尚未被研究，支撑我们的核心 gap 声明\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  # ============================================================\\\\n  # CATEGORY: safety-mechanism (additional — barrier functions)\\\\n  # ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"neuralcsbf2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Neural Configuration-Space Barriers for Manipulation Planning and Control\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Long et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2503.04929\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"safety-mechanism\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"学习 CDF barrier for manipulation，分布鲁棒公式\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"学习配置空间距离函数 (CDF) barrier，分布鲁棒公式处理建模误差和传感器噪声\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"Neural CS-BF 在配置空间操作需显式机器人模型；OCC-CBF 在占据特征空间操作，端到端与 VLA 联合\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  # ============================================================\\\\n  # CATEGORY: infrastructure (additional — base models / benchmarks)\\\\n  # ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"kim2024openvla\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"OpenVLA: An Open-Source Vision-Language-Action Model\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Kim et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2024\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2406.09246\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"infrastructure\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"开源 VLA 基础架构，OpenVLA-OFT 的前身\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"Llama 2 + DINOv2/SigLIP 视觉编码器，首个大规模开源 VLA，支持高效微调\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"OpenVLA 是 VLA 生态基础设施；我们在其微调变体 OFT 上构建实验\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"smolvla2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"SmolVLA: A Vision-Language-Action Model for Affordable and Efficient Robotics\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Shukor et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2506.01844\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"infrastructure\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"0.45B 轻量 VLA，单 GPU 训练，消费级部署\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"0.45B 参数 + 异步推理栈，单 GPU 训练，性能比肩 10x 大模型\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"SmolVLA 是轻量 VLA 基线；我们的方法可适配不同规模 VLA 架构\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - id: \\\\\\\"vlaeval2026\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"vla-eval: A Unified Evaluation Harness for Vision-Language-Action Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Choi et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2026\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2603.13966\\\\\\\"\\\\n    category: \\\\\\\"infrastructure\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: \\\\\\\"统一 VLA 评估框架，WebSocket+Docker 隔离\\\\\\\"\\\\n    key_finding: \\\\\\\"WebSocket+msgpack 协议解耦模型推理与 benchmark 执行，47x 吞吐提升\\\\\\\"\\\\n    our_differentiation: \\\\\\\"vla-eval 是评估基础设施；我们的安全评估指标可集成到此类统一框架\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 14963, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018fH1bx851t3wjnet2HMt5b","session_id":"d0b8a538-408e-485b-8d42-e69bd1c2f218","uuid":"f596beea-d2b3-47cd-8f52-9fe07451bef6","timestamp":"2026-05-23T04:37:55.471Z"}
